Z||000000||MikeSchaefer||08-31-2000||01:09 AM||||I just had an Idea, I'd like to drill a hole<BR>behind the sail-panel pontiac emblems, and put a small light behind them on each side.  I think it'll look cool at night.  Has anyone ever attempted this?<BR>Thanks,<BR>Mike Schaefer <A HREF="http://surf.to/fiero" TARGET=_blank>http://surf.to/fiero</A> ||||reg||3
